{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2019-11-11 22:30:00', 'title': 'LINDE PLC REPORTS EARNINGS RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019', 'text': 'LINDE PLC ANNOUNCED EARNINGS RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019. FOR THE THIRD QUARTER, THE COMPANY ANNOUNCED SALES WAS USD 7,000 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 3,008 MILLION A YEAR AGO. OPERATING INCOME WAS USD 1,000 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 669 MILLION A YEAR AGO. NET INCOME WAS USD 735 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 461 MILLION A YEAR AGO. BASIC EARNINGS PER SHARE FROM CONTINUING OPERATIONS WAS USD 1.35 COMPARED TO USD 1.6 A YEAR AGO. BASIC EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 1.36 COMPARED TO USD 1.6 A YEAR AGO. DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE FROM CONTINUING OPERATIONS WAS USD 1.34 COMPARED TO USD 1.58 A YEAR AGO. DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 1.35 COMPARED TO USD 1.58 A YEAR AGO. FOR THE NINE MONTHS, SALES WAS USD 21,148 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 9,035 MILLION A YEAR AGO. OPERATING INCOME WAS USD 2,278 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 2,011 MILLION A YEAR AGO. NET INCOME WAS USD 1,774 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 1,403 MILLION A YEAR AGO. BASIC EARNINGS PER SHARE FROM CONTINUING OPERATIONS WAS USD 3.09 COMPARED TO USD 4.87 A YEAR AGO. BASIC EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 3.27 COMPARED TO USD 4.87 A YEAR AGO. DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE FROM CONTINUING OPERATIONS WAS USD 3.07 COMPARED TO USD 4.82 A YEAR AGO. DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 3.25 COMPARED TO USD 4.82 A YEAR AGO.'}